name: add-endpoint
description: Add or change an HTTP route of this service's API (path, parameters, request and response schemas, status codes) on top of a use case, with its provider, router registration, API tests and OpenAPI contract. Use when the operation exists or is being added with add-use-case and only needs to be exposed over HTTP.
